From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 05:09:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] usb: typec: tcpm: Use the right SVID when resuming Discover
 Modes

When tcpm_vdm_discovery_work() resumes the discovery process after an
interruption, it picks the next SVID to send Discover Modes for from the
wrong place: in both VDM_DISCOVERY_PARTNER_MODES and
VDM_DISCOVERY_CABLE_MODES it indexes the cable's SVIDs with the
partner's SVID index.

Resuming in either state then sends Discover Modes for an SVID that the
port partner or cable never reported (usually 0x0000, as the array is
zeroed), so the mode of the SVID being discovered is never found.

Index the partner's SVIDs with the partner's index and the cable's SVIDs
with the cable's index.

Fixes: 205dc9cb39f5 ("usb: typec: tcpm: implement retry mechanism for Discover Identity VDMs")
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 drivers/usb/typec/tcpm/tcpm.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/usb/typec/tcpm/tcpm.c b/drivers/usb/typec/tcpm/tcpm.c
index 06692feb6d46..06c4ea34f466 100644
--- a/drivers/usb/typec/tcpm/tcpm.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/typec/tcpm/tcpm.c
@@ -7376,7 +7376,7 @@ static void tcpm_vdm_discovery_work(struct kthread_work *work)
 	case VDM_DISCOVERY_PARTNER_MODES:
 		/* Not all modes have been discovered yet */
 		if (modep->svid_index < modep->nsvids) {
-			msg[0] = VDO(modep_prime->svids[modep->svid_index], 1, svdm_version,
+			msg[0] = VDO(modep->svids[modep->svid_index], 1, svdm_version,
 				     CMD_DISCOVER_MODES);
 		} else if (tcpm_can_communicate_sop_prime(port) && tcpm_cable_vdm_supported(port)) {
 			tx_sop_type = TCPC_TX_SOP_PRIME;
@@ -7411,7 +7411,7 @@ static void tcpm_vdm_discovery_work(struct kthread_work *work)
 		if (modep_prime->svid_index < modep_prime->nsvids) {
 			tx_sop_type = TCPC_TX_SOP_PRIME;
 			svdm_version = typec_get_cable_svdm_version(typec);
-			msg[0] = VDO(modep_prime->svids[modep->svid_index], 1, svdm_version,
+			msg[0] = VDO(modep_prime->svids[modep_prime->svid_index], 1, svdm_version,
 				     CMD_DISCOVER_MODES);
 		} else {
 			goto unlock;
